<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the current state of a specified placeable object. The state will be a valid state defined by the state controller for the specified placeable. The placeable states are defined in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Placeables.xls" title="Placeables.xls">placeables.xls</a> file.
</p>
